{"id":"fry_01","caption":"Morning Yoga Flow & Recovery","pole":"tonal_column","items":["#43·18","#222·23","#257·29","#444·03","#254·04","#158·14","#119·05"],"day":"For an unknown autumn morning yoga session, a fitted emerald mock-neck sweater layered under a grey cardigan provides warmth and compression for the core. The brown animal-print bodysuit offers flexibility and moisture-wicking properties for movement, while the loose linen trousers ensure comfort during stretches without restriction. Beige suede ankle boots provide stability for standing poses on an unknown ground, complementing the neutral palette with an accent of yellow family green tones."},{"id":"fry_02","caption":"Urban Walk to Class in Style","pole":"filter_and_rank","items":["#53·18","#60·06","#42·32","#77·24","#92·32"],"day":"To navigate an unknown distance and weather to the yoga venue, a taupe fitted sweater keeps the body temperature regulated. A graphite fitted t-shirt adds a slimming layer beneath it if needed, or serves as a standalone breathable option. Navy straight-leg jeans in denim provide durability for walking on unknown streets and support for the legs. Grey pumps offer an elevated but comfortable finish for an autumn day, while beige mules serve as a ready alternative to slip into upon arrival."},{"id":"fry_03","caption":"Active Recovery & Stretching Focus","pole":"ease_the_knot","items":["#1·32","#97·25","#46·05","#141·32","#94·26"],"day":"A camel t-shirt with an abstract print acts as a relaxed top for stretching, layerable if the weather turns chilly. A green vest adds necessary structure to the torso without limiting movement. Wide-leg graphite trousers made of cotton offer a breezy silhouette that hides minor muscle fluctuations while remaining comfortable for long sessions. The lemon-colored straight-leg viscose trousers provide a high-waist option to define the hips, while yellow sneakers complete the athletic yet stylish look for any ground surface."},{"id":"fry_04","caption":"Post-Class Warmth & Comfort","pole":"filter_and_rank","items":["#25·27","#260·18","#129·15","#224·18"],"day":"After the session, a brown fitted bodysuit with animal print offers cozy comfort. A green belt secures the waist and adds a pop of color from the palette's edge. A grey beret fits securely for active hair management. A camel tote bag holds essentials like water and yoga mat, readying her for the unknown journey home."},{"id":"fry_05","caption":"Smart Casual Commute Look","pole":"tonal_column","items":["#28·36","#191·31","#172·06","#47·32","#329·15"],"day":"This outfit is designed for a smart casual transition from yoga to other activities. A grey zip-sweater provides warmth and texture. A cappuccino long-sleeve top adds a touch of elegance under the sweater. Light blue wide-leg jeans offer a relaxed fit that doesn't restrict movement after exercise. Grey heeled sandals balance the sporty vibe with sophistication for an autumn day, while a green headband keeps hair in place."},{"id":"fry_06","caption":"Layered Texture for Cool Days","pole":"anchor_first","items":["#384·01","#257·29","#122·23","#427·37","#102·15"],"day":"A graphite quilted coat serves as the outer layer to protect against autumn wind and rain, suitable for unknown weather conditions. Underneath, a brown animal-print bodysuit maintains flexibility. A grey knitted midi dress offers a complete silhouette if preferred over separate top and bottom pieces. A white belt defines the waist and adds structure. A grey beret completes the chic, monochromatic look."},{"id":"fry_07","caption":"Elegant Evening Yoga Retreat","pole":"filter_and_rank","items":["#319·03","#439·07","#294·27","#151·07","#417·34"],"day":"For a more formal yoga retreat or evening event, a beige leather crossbody bag holds necessities securely. A bright green clutch adds an unexpected accent of color. A grey blazer with double-breasted detailing offers sophistication and warmth. Black heeled sandals elevate the look for a special occasion on any surface. A black beret adds a touch of mystery and style."},{"id":"fry_08","caption":"Comfortable Outdoor Class","pole":"anchor_first","items":["#379·12","#49·32","#115·12","#369·31"],"day":"A chocolate down jacket with a hood protects against cold winds and light precipitation during an outdoor yoga session. Pink joggers provide comfort and flexibility for movement. Beige bermuda shorts offer a different leg option for warmer moments or rest periods. A brown cardigan adds an extra layer of warmth that can be removed if needed."},{"id":"fry_09","caption":"Stylish Studio Session","pole":"tonal_column","items":["#36·29","#68·12","#174·25","#205·17"],"day":"A grey zip-sweater creates a neutral base. A chocolate bodysuit adds depth and warmth for cooler temperatures. A green straight skirt in midi length provides elegance and modesty. Green sneakers ensure comfort and stability during active poses."},{"id":"fry_10","caption":"Versatile Layering Option","pole":"ease_the_knot","items":["#289·20","#436·31","#176·09","#95·03"],"day":"A chocolate jersey hoodie offers warmth and comfort for an unknown outdoor setting. A grey half-coat adds an extra layer of protection against wind and light rain. A beige straight skirt in midi length provides a classic silhouette. Beige loafers complete the look with comfort and sophistication."}
]
